0b10574109957855881342b8232d6d1483573874f","rendered_turn_sha256":"d696d91fa1e23d32f296c817ed4eb5d788f2bf364dcec598fbb6c83de904e0b8","session_date":"2023-10-23","session_datetime":"2023-10-23T14:17:00","session_id":"session_25","session_index":25,"source_sha256":"ed831046d2af0d43672203bcd697cf69661fd55e4b488794826838f7ab6ed64b","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":7},{"dia_id":"D25:8","global_turn_index":432,"locator":"[S25T8]","raw_turn_sha256":"cee0249de7b2cb594948995f20ebd745fc9d7b70094ebfd3b9f52ac9b4799ecb","rendered_turn_sha256":"0eb9d18ba62634f55b60ba91046ac5d042414f07ae43e69e52eda485c6993ca3","session_date":"2023-10-23","session_datetime":"2023-10-23T14:17:00","session_id":"session_25","session_index":25,"source_sha256":"4ae851d3b9ae96397e3736d66c915c5fd98c2c25e11aedf5ec6790240c6ee662","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":8},{"dia_id":"D25:9","global_turn_index":433,"locator":"[S25T9]","raw_turn_sha256":"805adf2b600965145a664feb46829f563b20f5536f6aa042e3171a9eaddc822b","rendered_turn_sha256":"de3cd3c4b6810b8b2cfbf9baf1ec9625e17566cb062c52620b7e0541dfe56c5e","session_date":"2023-10-23","session_datetime":"2023-10-23T14:17:00","session_id":"session_25","session_index":25,"source_sha256":"00fc6d49ca990210c5ac203602f02cbc05d499522635ffac25be01d43c8460d0","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":9},{"dia_id":"D25:10","global_turn_index":434,"locator":"[S25T10]","raw_turn_sha256":"65d96c87bc599ab9c86074d0e180f735437715423f279c180c1fc52b9234793c","rendered_turn_sha256":"724d059988b1d392e9317f3ec309daafcfdf9132f00b5dd99d1c30852403a470","session_date":"2023-10-23","session_datetime":"2023-10-23T14:17:00","session_id":"session_25","session_index":25,"source_sha256":"c1a2ab65fb9b8a84ebbb3223adcce34d4ceb9e804c530f785b11ef90090a6f02","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":10}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Dave: Hey Calvin, how's the tour with Frank Ocean? I was pondering our chat the other day about fame and its impact on relationships. It must be awesome but it must have its own struggles too. How are you juggling your job plus your personal life?\n[S25T1] (dia_id: D25:1)\n\nCalvin: The tour's been incredible! Performing and connecting with the crowd has been so energizing. Yeah, fame has its own challenges. It's been tough trying to balance everything.\n[S25T2] (dia_id: D25:2)\n\nDave: How are you managing everything? Do you ever feel overwhelmed?\n[S25T3] (dia_id: D25:3)\n\nCalvin: I take it one day at a time, but it can get overwhelming with so many demands. Still, I enjoy what I do so I push on.\n[S25T4] (dia_id: D25:4)\n\nDave: Glad you're finding joy in what you do! Any strategies that help you manage everything?\n[S25T5] (dia_id: D25:5)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, having a strong support system is really helpful. My friends and team keep me on track.\n[S25T6] (dia_id: D25:6)\n\nDave: Cool! Having people who understand and support you is really important. I recently had a good conversation with some neighbors about current events and politics. It was nice to hear different perspectives and share our own. Interacting like that cheers me up and helps me stay informed - how about you?\n[S25T7] (dia_id: D25:7)\n\nCalvin: Staying connected and up-to-date on world events is important to me. It helps my music stand out by incorporating unique perspectives and connects me better with my fans. Plus, it keeps me motivated and inspired.\n[S25T8] (dia_id: D25:8)\n\nDave: Cool, Calvin! Art is amazing how it reflects the world. Has anything caught your eye lately and made an impact on your music?\n[S25T9] (dia_id: D25:9)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, for sure! Recently, I've been really inspired by some of the struggles that people go through. It's made me dig deeper into my music to try to capture those feelings.\n[S25T10] (dia_id: D25:10)","text_sha256":"504a0b602072c2595c459d7df3c222dd1c54556be376a1080aea5d7c712ca43f","timestamp":"2023-10-23T14:17:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bf