ator":"[S29T11]","raw_turn_sha256":"6c862cfbcdedb2f7dca1f794afd3d466f8fb79a5a56034ac0a81f1f3e489a686","rendered_turn_sha256":"062c94139fd802ca210405b114e2cc3e774faac5ba9380ae71d015495187914f","session_date":"2023-11-13","session_datetime":"2023-11-13T21:15:00","session_id":"session_29","session_index":29,"source_sha256":"aa382ff21a5877b8fdfc2b65a43fa01148b52a98977d59b85cbb0985e845d846","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":11},{"dia_id":"D29:12","global_turn_index":538,"locator":"[S29T12]","raw_turn_sha256":"5cf11845e76b943a4a947e7724eea98a8025bd4819cc9f862c749ea8992c3991","rendered_turn_sha256":"b47deae7110b02a4d693d1da323a13342e76307af25ede8841eecb26e40abcf0","session_date":"2023-11-13","session_datetime":"2023-11-13T21:15:00","session_id":"session_29","session_index":29,"source_sha256":"c3e47b6c47e1186abc84cf103a46d64e271acfea1c0a745587c3f3586cd2b0d8","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":12},{"dia_id":"D29:13","global_turn_index":539,"locator":"[S29T13]","raw_turn_sha256":"f403014a61337dcbe6748d6e2bff1bd7197fc7f0ef219c95d82cff3fa5afeea2","rendered_turn_sha256":"527e9ed03aca64039ddb76c197b5c4bb6b5c141605beacff2e58418a91b34568","session_date":"2023-11-13","session_datetime":"2023-11-13T21:15:00","session_id":"session_29","session_index":29,"source_sha256":"c0bd7e54be6af1793c17795efd1052097f086b58fab87e5891d3e7636668b042","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":13},{"dia_id":"D29:14","global_turn_index":540,"locator":"[S29T14]","raw_turn_sha256":"1ae7452f8ea8b3656a5322a4eda473e4b07e63d25e4246e177e6a4b6922e9e5f","rendered_turn_sha256":"3703476815afc34bf3168ce299d4cce80fb4df445ca57ab47bcac0279202f9ed","session_date":"2023-11-13","session_datetime":"2023-11-13T21:15:00","session_id":"session_29","session_index":29,"source_sha256":"c0dfee27efe747037f951d00c7ae6445c3c74f6bab859a51202cc3f1e750582c","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":14}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Calvin: He's been such a great friend to me. Always there to support and encourage me. His positivity has made a big difference in my journey.\n[S29T5] (dia_id: D29:5)\n\nDave: It's great how someone's support and encouragement can really shape our lives! They give us the motivation to keep going and trust ourselves. Do you also find having supportive people around you important for your artist development?\n[S29T6] (dia_id: D29:6)\n\nCalvin: Having supportive people is key for me to grow as an artist. They motivate me to get better and stay true to myself. Having support is vital, especially in this tough music industry. Take a look at this photo!\n[Image caption: a photography of a group of people sitting around a desk]\n[S29T7] (dia_id: D29:7)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! Is this a pic of some musicians you're collaborating with?\n[S29T8] (dia_id: D29:8)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, I've been supporting some young musicians from a music program. Supporting their passion is amazing and their enthusiasm is inspiring.\n[S29T9] (dia_id: D29:9)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin, that's amazing! You're really making a difference by supporting the next generation of musicians. It's great to nurture their passion and help them thrive.\n[S29T10] (dia_id: D29:10)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! It's like a torch being passed to keep music alive! These young musicians are very ambitious, I think I will support them for a long time.\t\n[S29T11] (dia_id: D29:11)\n\nDave: Yeah, Calvin! Your support for them keeps the music going and passes on the legacy. That's so awesome!\n[S29T12] (dia_id: D29:12)\n\nCalvin: I'm stoked I made a difference. Paying it forward, ya know? Working with new talent brings new ideas to this. Look at this photo, here's how I'm making a beat for a young artist, he has great potential in music! \n[Image caption: a photo of a man sitting at a desk in front of a computer]\n[S29T13] (dia_id: D29:13)\n\nDave: Wow, that's cool! Your music studio looks great. Have you tried out any new ideas lately?\n[S29T14] (dia_id: D29:14)","